# Files that must never be uploaded to a Vercel build.
#
# The local SQLite database above all. It is gitignored, but .gitignore does not
# govern what the Vercel CLI uploads — a `vercel --prod` from a developer's
# machine was shipping prisma/dev.db into the build container, where the build's
# own `prisma migrate deploy` then happily migrated IT instead of the real
# database. It also carries the seeded owner's password hash and invite codes.
prisma/dev.db
prisma/*.db
*.db
*.db-journal

# Local database exports. These contain password hashes, invite codes and every
# private message on the site.
backups/

.env*
.next/
node_modules/
